#: ../../source/libraries/pagination.rst:119
msgid "Specifying the URI Segment for Page"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/libraries/pagination.rst:121
msgid ""
"It is also possible to use a URI segment for the page number, instead of "
"the page query parameter. Simply specify the segment number to use as the"
" fourth argument. URIs generated by the pager would then look like "
"**https://domain.tld/foo/bar/[pageNumber]** instead of "
"**https://domain.tld/foo/bar?page=[pageNumber]**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/libraries/pagination.rst:127
#: ../../source/libraries/pagination.rst:150
msgid ""
"Please note: ``$segment`` value cannot be greater than the number of URI "
"segments plus 1."
msgstr ""

